## 💻 Code & Core Architecture Overview

- **SPA Client-Side Routing Fix**: whitelisted '/login', '/explorer', and '/admin' routes in SecurityConfig.java so browser direct reloads do not trigger 403 Forbidden.
- **Auto-Seeding Database**: DataSeeder.java automatically loads 30 design patterns and creating default admin account on start.
- **Axios Interceptor**: api.ts adds Bearer JWT tokens to all requests automatically.
- **Tailwind CSS v4 Configuration**: Configured @tailwindcss/vite compiler in vite.config.ts and import themes in index.css.
